WEBVTT

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:21.770
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:25.360
Gourmet Hunters are explorers 
who travel the world,

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:28.940
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:33.200
And the ingredient at 
the top of this world

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.290
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:37.970
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:10.300
The first round of the Cooking 
Fest's final tournament,

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:12.420
the Darkness Cooking Duel, has begun!

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:15.210
Komatsu's opponent is Chef Zaus.

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:21.220
However, just then, the Gourmet 
Corp.'s army invaded the arena.

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:28.890
We're not off to a very good start,

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:32.220
but this means war!

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:38.640
Moreover, someone in the Dark Cooking 
tent grabbed Komatsu's hand!

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:42.470
And it was Starjun!

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:53.370
Star...!

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:59.450
Protect Komatsu! Toriko vs. Starjun!

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:43.200
H-Hey...

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:46.440
What is this?!

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:56.110
W-What's going on?!

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:18.670
Who the hell are they?!

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:07.230
I've come for you,

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:09.720
boy.

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:28.240
Poison Sound Armor!

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:30.610
Z-Zebra-san!

00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:34.710
Dumbass!

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:36.850
I got ya!

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:39.380
Spread, lethal poison!

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:51.630
I covered the Sound 
Armor with my poison.

00:05:54.990 --> 00:05:56.700
Thermal Disinfection!

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:05.910
He made it disappear, Coco!

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:08.050
That's okay.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:10.610
Sunny's on his way.

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:29.810
Now, Tori...

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:35.070
Campfire!

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:42.280
Hot!

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:44.470
M-Matsu!

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:57.330
Hey! This is dangerous!

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:59.480
Run!

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:43.510
I'll kill ya!

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:49.150
You tryin' to put a damper 
on the Fest?! Bastards!

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:40.220
Tor...

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:54.710
Toriko-san!

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:44.900
I've been waiting for you,

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:47.280
Toriko.

00:09:58.580 --> 00:09:59.550
Toriko-san!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.130
Let's step outside...

00:10:08.410 --> 00:10:10.490
...Starjun!

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:13.730
There's no need to step out.

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:15.500
We're already outside here.

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:20.060
Campfire Medium Blaze!

00:10:49.050 --> 00:10:50.400
Kid!

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.900
Toriko! Komatsu-kun!

00:11:58.700 --> 00:11:59.740
What the...?

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:01.270
That's...

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:06.260
...C-Chef Zaus!

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:13.500
Zaus...

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:25.320
How dare you ruin the Fest?

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:34.970
Zebra! Put up a barrier in 
front of the spectators!

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:54.630
Leg...

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:01.750
...Knife!

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:18.210
Matsu!

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:26.030
Sound Wall!

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:50.420
Leg...

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:55.880
...Fork!

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:12.760
Toriko is suddenly going full throttle!

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:17.120
It's tough puttin' up a barrier 
that covers all the fans

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:20.040
and can withstand this kinda battle.

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:27.390
Coco, don't mind me.

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:30.750
Go ahead and annihilate all of 'em!

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:32.130
Okay.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:34.020
Got it.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:43.390
I'll pelt you

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:45.750
with poison bullets so deadly,

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:47.670
they won't even leave your bones behind.

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:52.520
Machine Gun Poison

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:41.720
Delicious!

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:43.760
You sucked up the poison...

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:46.690
If memory serves...

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:53.490
You're one of the Vice-Chefs 
of Gourmet Corp., Grinpatch!

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:57.650
You called, Coco of the Four Kings?!

00:15:57.650 --> 00:16:01.790
Hey, gimme some more of those bullets!

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:04.180
I love bullets!

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:12.550
Sure.

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:18.030
And I'll make them even more dangerous.

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:24.560
I'm going to fall!

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:26.130
Don't panic, Matsu!

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:28.770
I'll protect you!

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:31.670
So relax and be my partner!

00:16:38.770 --> 00:16:39.380
Ow!

00:16:47.370 --> 00:16:51.530
You're Sunny of the Four Kings, right?

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:54.540
What a delight!

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:57.760
Nice to meet you!

00:16:58.690 --> 00:17:01.770
I'm one of the Vice-Chefs 
of Gourmet Corp...

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:05.470
Tommyrod!

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:13.140
D-D-

00:17:14.060 --> 00:17:20.220
Disgusting!

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:23.260
I'll let my bugs feed on you!

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:32.600
Gross! Gross! Gross!

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:34.170
Gross! Gross! Gross!

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:35.980
Gross! Gross!

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:37.150
Gross!!

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:38.640
Gross!!!

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:49.980
Equals... I'm gonna kick your ass!

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:33.620
Run!

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:40.450
That's it...

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:44.540
No matter how many of you 
Gourmet Corp. jerks there are,

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:50.000
we're gonna give a beat down 
to every last one of ya!

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:16.270
Guess the Legend! The 
Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:16.520
Guess the Legend! The 
Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:18.650
I'm your host, Tina.

00:21:18.650 --> 00:21:21.210
Now, in this segment, you guess

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:25.330
the legendary ingredients 
of the Gourmet Age!

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:35.190
Really?! Level 5

00:21:29.900 --> 00:21:32.600
Today's "Really?!" level is 5!

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:35.210
Someone once said...

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:38.430
Heavenly voice! Please 
help me today too!

00:21:38.840 --> 00:21:41.980
Okay, okay. Here we go.

00:21:42.390 --> 00:21:44.620
Someone once said...

00:21:45.350 --> 00:21:48.010
There's a salad filled with healthy,

00:21:48.010 --> 00:21:53.240
low-calorie tuna that 
looks like Zebra's head.

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:55.890
Something something something!

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:58.590
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:21:58.590 --> 00:22:00.040
Start!

00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:03.560
Zebra? Salad?

00:22:04.390 --> 00:22:06.380
Low-calorie tuna is...?

00:22:06.890 --> 00:22:08.640
Light tuna?

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:13.580
Someone once said...

00:22:14.210 --> 00:22:16.990
There's a salad filled with healthy,

00:22:16.990 --> 00:22:22.500
low-calorie tuna that 
looks like Zebra's head.

00:22:22.880 --> 00:22:27.510
Zebralight Tuna Salad!

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:30.370
Zebralight Tuna Salad!

00:22:30.630 --> 00:22:33.330
I think I'd be a little 
scared to eat it...

00:22:36.510 --> 00:22:38.890
It was actually really good.

00:22:38.890 --> 00:22:40.640
You've had it before?

00:22:40.950 --> 00:22:43.880
And now let's get back on 
track with our next segment!
